<title>POLAND: Polish KPW clears PPAB 1-for-4 rights.</title>
<headline>Polish KPW clears PPAB 1-for-4 rights.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) cleared a one-for-four rights issue of First Polish-American Bank (PPABank), the KPW said in a statement.</p>
<p>PPABank said the record day for issue of 1.25 million new shares would be January 6.</p>
<p>The first subscription period is scheduled from January 13 to February 3 and the second leg from February 24 to March 10 next year in case the issue was not fully subscribed during the first subscription period.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
